{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_WII__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_WII__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the Wii target is
	being used.  This is normally selected by ##fbc-wii## or by the
	##-target wii## command line option.  It can be used to compile parts of a
	program only for the Wii target.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_WII__
	print "Wii target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	[[DevBuildWii|Compiling FB for Wii]]
	[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]
